          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit makes a Psychic Test, if there is a friendly SUM M ONED FLAM ERS unit in the battlefield, add 1 SUM M ONED FLAM ERS model to that unit. Otherwise, create a SUM M ONED FLAM ERS unit within 1" of this unit outside of the engagement range of enemy units with 1 model, and that unit is ready.</characteristic>
