          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">While this unit is in the battlefield, when you roll for initiative, if this unit is within 9" of another with Entwined Will, you may add 1 D6 to that initiative roll.</characteristic>
