        <profile name="Immutable Sarcophigae" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="0832-ebe6-ea7a-14bf">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After any unit is Activated, if this unit has one or more SCARAB OCCULT TERM INATORS models, until the End step, this unit gains Resilient 6+.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Teleport Homer" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability" hidden="false" id="a5c7-0547-be9c-1fdf">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit is Activated in reserves, if it is your first turn in a row, you may use'teleport homer'. If you do, select one of your infantry units without Teleport Homer and roll D6+2. Then, Deploy this unit wholly within X" of the selected unit where X is the result of that roll. Then, during this turn's Move step, do not make a Move Roll and this unit cannot Advance or Reposition.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="4820-e2b5-9e00-bb68" id="c054-147c-a3c3-b4bd" primary="true" name="Elites"/>
