                    <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit’s Attacks step, if there is a friendly SUMMONED PINK HORRORS unit on the battlefield, add 1 SUMMONED PINK HORRORS model to that unit. Otherwise, create a SUMMONED PINK HORRORS unit within 1” of this unit outside of the engagement range of enemy units with 1 model. That unit is ready.</characteristic>
